  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRF Empowering Civil Society Action for Resilience and Recovery of Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves a partnership between two large Ukrainian civil society organisations (CSO), International Renaissance Foundation (IRF) and the East European Foundation (EEF), which will work with smaller CSOs  to address early recovery and democratic reforms in Ukraine. Among other things, the project will also build capacity of member organisations in gender sensitive budgeting and collection and use of gender disaaggregated data and also build capacity in sustainable and green recovery and climate action.</narrative>
  </description>
